"","","",""],"head_icon":"637501.png","audio":"613101256","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……真叫人怀念啊。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_1/3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.jpg","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,67,""]],"type":1,"name":["鲍里斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637501.png","audio":"613101257","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["当初你也是像这样，力排众议让我留在了组织里。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_1/3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["军官眯起眼，思绪仿佛又回到了那个遥远的夏天。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_1/3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.jpg","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["鲍里斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637501.png","audio":"613101258","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那时我们的想法很简单。为了联合……为了建设一个统一的“色雷斯解放阵线”。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_1/3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.jpg","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["鲍里斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637501.png","audio":"613101259","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["无视血统，无视种族，所有人都一样，我们都在同一个大家庭里。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_1/3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.jpg","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]],"type":1,"name":["鲍里斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637501.png","audio":"613101260","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["白天，我们在山林中穿行，翻越雪线，炸毁敌人的补给线，把那些骑兵吓得连马粪都不敢留在原地。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/3_1/3_1_bg_bangongchexiang.jpg","choice":[]},"71":{"step":[[71,72,""]],"type":1,"name":["鲍里斯","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"637501.png","audio":"613101261","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["晚上，我们围着篝火，一起修枪，烤面包，唱那些老掉牙的游击战歌，像一家人那样。","","","","","","",""],